                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Livre de recettes contre les maladies des chevaux: with additional receipts by a later 17th cent. hand, etc. On the first leaf:'LE AV NAR'. The last section is headed in capital letters: 'Leszacament [sic] Quil F Avlt Ferre A Vn Companon Qant Il Se Vevlt Passer Maistre De Loffice De Marich Avt A Tovlouze 1608' This is in the form of Question and Answer. At the end 'Fin de leszaman [sic] de toulouze 1608 escrit par darnol estant a paris 1608'.</summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="fr" source="IANA">French</textLang>
                        <msItem n="1" xml:id="MS_229_1">
                            <author/>
                            <title type="original">Darnol</title>
                            <title type="standard"/>
                            <textLang mainLang="fr" source="IANA">French</textLang>
                            <filiation/>
